========================================================================
COMPLETE NODE TYPE INDEX  (all C++ classes defined in node.h)
========================================================================
Status legend:
  FINAL        — survives in the final AST; write a visit() for it
  LEAF         — terminal, no children; only visit() needed
  ABSORBED     — deleted by a passalong action; see table above
  INTERMEDIATE — created during parsing but never retained in the final AST
  UNUSED       — class exists in node.h but is never instantiated

nodeType value = the string stored in node::nodeType at runtime (set by makeLeaf /
                 passAlong / makeSubTree / makeBinarySubTree in parser.cpp).
semanticMeaning = what is stored in node::semanticMeaning (differs from nodeType for
                  several nodes; see column below).

