KEY QUIRKS:
  - intNode stores nodeType="intnum" (not "int") — matches the token type name.
  - funcdeclfamNode stores nodeType="funcdecl", identical to funcdeclNode.
    Distinguish them by C++ type in the visitor, not by nodeType string.
  - reptstatement4Node's semanticMeaning is ":=" (absorbed from the assignNode leaf).
  - floatNode is declared in node.h and visitor.h but is never instantiated in
    handleAction — the float type keyword is captured by typeNode ("type") instead.